      <trans-unit id="ValueSet-mii-vs-labor-loinc-ontology-mchc-standard" resname="ValueSet.description">
             <notes>
               <note id="n1">ValueSet.description</note>
             </notes>
        <source>Proposal: LOINC codes of the clinical test 'Mean cell hemoglobin concentration (MCHC)' (standard tier, specimen Blood), computed by ECL over the LOINC Ontology 2026-03-21. Parts: LOINC enumeration (2), LOINC Ontology observables without LOINC code (0), and the ECL as an intensional include. ECL: &lt;&lt; 521371010000101 |Mean cell hemoglobin concentration (observable entity)| : &lt;&lt; 370132008 |Scale type (attribute)| = &lt;&lt; 30766002 |Quantitative value (qualifier value)|</source>
        <target></target>
      </trans-unit>
